OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA clear,
OL,6,Fchilly evening, before cloud thickens
OL,7,Ffrom the southwest overnight. Perhaps
OL,8,Fthe odd frost patch. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening for a time after
OL,10,Fmidnight, especially along coasts,
OL,11,Fwith rain spreading north.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FWet start early morning, with
OL,14,Frain clearing north. While some drier
OL,15,Fintervals follow, further outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain and showers are also likely,
OL,17,Fheavy at times. Winds also
OL,18,Fstrengthening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
